      "review": "source_name_identity_user_wording_and_attached_particles_verified_layout_pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-terms-19bf8c",
      "text": "너희들의　힘은　마왕　자바바를\n이기기　위함이겠지%k\n주저하지　마\n얻은　힘을　마음껏　사용해",
      "review": "source_name_identity_user_wording_and_attached_particles_verified_layout_pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-terms-19c3e4",
      "text": "왜　크레스와　함께　있었는지\n나도　잘　모르겠어%k\n클라스는　전설이　변하고\n있다고　말했지만…",
      "review": "source_name_identity_user_wording_and_attached_particles_verified_layout_pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-terms-19ca38",
      "text": "해롤드\n만남의　유적",
      "review": "source_name_identity_user_wording_and_attached_particles_verified_layout_pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue-terms-19caf8",
